That date is the planned handoff date from the digest, not a signed record. I couldn't see the CRM, and I found no other confirmation. Check it against the CRM's own history before you treat it as official.

Don't confuse this with Covey & Lark Retail. Its "PHL" shorthand collides with Pellucid Harbor Logistics, so check the org ID.
